  "summary": "A post-apocalyptic aesthetic set in desert wastelands, featuring sand-blasted machinery, nomadic cultures, and survival technology.",
  "description": "Desertpunk is a post-apocalyptic aesthetic set in desert wastelands. It features sand-blasted machinery, nomadic cultures, survival technology, and the harsh beauty of arid landscapes. The aesthetic draws from Mad Max, Dune, and post-apocalyptic fiction, emphasizing scarcity, resilience, and the visual language of sand, rust, and sun-bleached materials.",
